WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:08.019
Telo Ride now has a Settings page: how it looks, sounds and moves on this device.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.288
It opens from Profile's Ride settings row, with Profile still current in the header.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.223
Five sections, each a landmark with its heading, and a nav that goes to each one.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.941
Turn Keep the screen awake off, and it applies at once, with no Save. It stays on

00:00:40.941 --> 00:00:44.327
this device, and a class ride lets the screen sleep.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:51.437
Settings, from a phone to the full screen.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.037
Reset puts every setting back. And where the browser keeps nothing, Settings says

00:01:04.037 --> 00:01:06.300
so, and every control still works.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.288
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:19.145
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.816
every hill and interval.

00:01:21.161 --> 00:01:26.339
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:26.339 --> 00:01:31.787
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:31.787 --> 00:01:34.777
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:37.615
A custom workout lives under Profile.
